@* What the agent does for a business (F128.1), straight after the offer: three things an owner feels, each in its own
   colour. *@
<Band Id="does" Kicker="What it does">
    <h2 class="chrome reveal">Your best employee, at ten at night.</h2>
    <TileRow>
        <Tile Title="It knows your business" Accent="TileAccent.Green">Your hours, your prices, your services and your story, from a few plain files. Change a file and it knows, no developer needed.</Tile>
        <Tile Title="It answers while you sleep" Accent="TileAccent.Blue" Delay="1">The questions you get every day, answered at night and over the weekend, so a customer stays instead of trying the next place.</Tile>
        <Tile Title="It knows when to pass on" Accent="TileAccent.Yellow" Delay="2">A booking, a complaint or something it doesn't know goes to you, with the customer's details once they say yes.</Tile>
    </TileRow>
    <p class="band-note"><a href="/what-we-build">What we build</a>, in more detail.</p>
</Band>
